Article 3 (Scope of Enterprises Subject to Priority Management)
Enterprises subject to priority management under Article 11 of the Act and Article 10 of the Decree shall be enterprises designated by the Minister of Employment and Labor from among the following: <Amended on December 16, 2022>
1. Korea Workers' Compensation and Welfare Service under Article 10 of the Industrial Accident Compensation Insurance Act;
2. Korea Occupational Safety and Health Agency under the Korea Occupational Safety and Health Agency Act;
3. Human Resources Development Service of Korea under the Human Resources Development Service of Korea Act;
4. Korea Polytechnics established by the Human Resources Development Service of Korea pursuant to Article 26 (1) of the Human Resources Development Service of Korea Act;
5. Other institutions or organizations designated by the Minister of Employment and Labor as necessary for the efficient performance of emergency-preparedness affairs under the jurisdiction of the Ministry of Employment and Labor.
